# Lyra Sat Gadget partition table, XIAO ESP32S3 8 MB flash.
# Table offset 0x10000 (sdkconfig.defaults). SINGLE-APP since sat1
# (Daniel, 2026-10-30): OTA is REMOVED -- updates are USB flashes (the
# assembled box keeps USB accessible, and the device stays lean). One
# large factory app fills the space the two OTA slots used; no otadata,
# no frames partition (no display); the alarm sound is embedded in the
# app binary. coredump is kept for headless crash forensics.
# Name,    Type, SubType, Offset,   Size,     Flags
nvs,       data, nvs,     0x11000,  0xC000,
phy_init,  data, phy,     0x1D000,  0x1000,
factory,   app,  factory, 0x20000,  0x7C0000,
coredump,  data, coredump,0x7E0000, 0x20000,
